# EXPECT-SUBSTRING: simd_scale chi ho tro mang
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# simd_scale CHI co ban MANG (ScaleF32(float32[], float32, float32[])).
# Truoc 2026-11-04, truyen `list[f32]` van di qua duong nay: compiler phat
# `call ScaleF32` voi doi tuong List tren stack -> CLR nem InvalidProgram/
# AccessViolation luc CHAY (khong phai luc dich). Nay phai bi tu choi som.

def run() -> "i32":
    a: "list[f32]" = []
    a.append(1.0)
    o: "list[f32]" = []
    o.append(0.0)
    simd_scale(a, 2.0, o)
    return 0
